sequenceDiagram
    participant A as 管理端 index.html
    participant R as AdminFirmwareRouter
    participant F as firmware_config
    participant DB as SQLite
    participant D as 设备固件
    participant O as ota_check(voice)

    A->>R: PATCH /api/admin/firmware {version,url}
    R->>R: get_current_admin（非管理员 403）
    R->>F: validate()（半配/超长/非 http(s) → 400）
    F->>DB: SELECT firmware_config WHERE id=1
    alt 无行
        F->>DB: INSERT id=1（并发双写：IntegrityError → 重取后更新）
    else 有行
        F->>DB: UPDATE version/url/updated_by
    end
    F->>DB: INSERT firmware_config_audits（同一事务）
    F->>DB: COMMIT（业务+审计一次提交）
    R-->>A: 200 {source:"database", ...}
    Note over A,R: 保存即生效：无缓存，下次读取现查 DB

    D->>O: POST /api/voice/ota（Device-Id=MAC）
    O->>F: _firmware_section(db) → get_effective(db)
    F->>DB: SELECT firmware_config WHERE id=1
    F-->>O: FirmwareEffective(source=database)
    O-->>D: {server_time, websocket, firmware:{version,url}}

sequenceDiagram
    participant FW as 设备固件 sync.c
    participant S as device_api.sync
    participant DB as SQLite
    participant U as 用户端 user.html
    participant L as devices.list_devices
    participant F as firmware_config

    FW->>S: POST /api/device/sync?fw_version=…&hw_model=ESP32-S3
    S->>DB: UPDATE devices SET fw_version, hardware_model
    S-->>FW: DeviceSyncOut（device 段含 hardware_model）

    U->>L: GET /api/devices
    L->>DB: SELECT devices WHERE owner_id=…
    L->>F: get_effective(db)（每次请求一次）
    F->>DB: SELECT firmware_config WHERE id=1
    F-->>L: FirmwareEffective
    L-->>U: [DeviceOut{…, hardware_model, bound_at, latest_fw_version}]
